ith deprecated compatibility aliases by @appcypher in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1708\n### Fixes\n* fix(cli): prevent piped exec from hanging on stdin by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1674\n* fix(sandbox): reject snapshot patches before creating storage by @rahulpatle-sol in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1607\n* fix(sandbox): keep lower directory metadata for patch parents by @gerritlansing in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1690\n* fix(release): repair labeling and retry registry propagation by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1698\n* fix(ci): repair type generation and stabilize sandbox test cleanup by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1697\n* fix(network): allow placeholders on trusted secret hosts by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1700\n* fix(network): propagate guest FIN on published ports by @skorfmann in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1706\n* fix(network): make readable denial responses opt-in by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1694\n### Documentation\n* docs(cli): clarify entrypoint argument handling by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1699\n### Maintenance\n* chore: refresh lockfiles after v0.7.4 by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1673\n* chore: release v0.7.5 by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1711\n\n## New Contributors\n* @rahulpatle-sol made their first contribution in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1607\n* @gerritlansing made their first contribution in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1690\n* @yashau made their first contribution in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1606\n* @skorfmann made their first contribution in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1706\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/compare/v0.7.4...v0.7.5","mentions_count":7}
